    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "マヤノトップガン",
            "enName": "Mayano Top Gun",
            "jpText": "マベちん、お誕生日おめでとーっ！",
            "enText": "Marvey, happy birthday!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 532882829241608439,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マーベラスサンデー",
            "enName": "Marvelous Sunday",
            "jpText": "マーベラス☆\n今日はとってもマーベラース！",
            "enText": "Marvelous☆ Today is most MARVELOUS!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 8768648350042375369,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "誕生日最高って感じ？　アンタのマーベラス、\r\n段々わかるようになってきたわ……。",
            "enText": "You mean birthdays rock, yeah? \nI think I'm starting to get the hang \nof your \"marvelous\" usage…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -1482757208900359610,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マヤノトップガン",
            "enName": "Mayano Top Gun",
            "jpText": "今夜は、マベちんのお部屋で\nお泊まりパーティーするんだもんね～！",
            "enText": "Tonight, we're having a sleepover party \nin Marvey's room!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -7780918089472071030,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マーベラスサンデー",
            "enName": "Marvelous Sunday",
            "jpText": "マーベラース☆",
            "enText": "Marvelous☆",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -4407256414185985647,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "楽しみ～って言いたいのはわかったけど、\nそもそもアンタの部屋ってアタシの部屋\nでもあるんだけど。",
            "enText": "I know you're saying that it's gonna be \nsuper exciting, but don't forget that your \nroom is also my room.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 7871998820094665916,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "お泊まりパーティーとか聞いてないよ？\nひと晩中騒ぐつもり？",
            "enText": "I haven't heard anything about a sleepover \nparty. Are you guys gonna make a racket \nthe entire night?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 9053393763369324774,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マヤノトップガン",
            "enName": "Mayano Top Gun",
            "jpText": "……え？　お泊まりに行っちゃダメ……？",
            "enText": "…Huh? So we can't have a sleepover…?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 3234387665264837354,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マーベラスサンデー",
            "enName": "Marvelous Sunday",
            "jpText": "ネイチャ……。",
            "enText": "Nature…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 2729334567275266752,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "くっ……そ、そんな小動物みたいな目で……。\nわかったから！　別にお泊まりしていいから！",
            "enText": "Ngh… D-Don't give me those puppy eyes… \nAll right, fine, you can have your sleepover!",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 919888357812763724,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マーベラスサンデー",
            "enName": "Marvelous Sunday",
            "jpText": "わ～いっ！　ネイチャとってもマーベラス☆",
            "enText": "Yaaay! You're marvelous!☆",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -5055033439621906955,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "はいはい、大好きって言いたいのね……。\nそりゃ、ありがとござんした。",
            "enText": "Yes, yes, I know you love me… \nand I'm grateful for it.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 4801188057918010212,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
